window.products.push({"id":178435,"name":"Vintage Paris Painting Eiffel Tower Pink Rose Flower Spring Cityscape Anti Fatigue Kitchen Mat Comfort Floor Mats Non-Slip Oil Stain Resistant Easy to","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713WRqr8PpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"\"The kitchen rug made by us is well known for its high quality, excellent design and exclamatory craft. We regard continuous innovation and produce high quality carpet as the highest goal. Modern kitchen rug mat are suitable for hard floor provide protection and cushioning for floor.  Product Information:  1.Material: Thick polyester, non-woven fabric and PVC granular bottom  2.Size:17.7x47.2 inches  3.Package included:1 x modern kitchen rug mat  4.Style:Modern/fashion/interesting/customized  FEATURE:  1.This kitchen rug is water absorption and oil stain resistant, keep your kitchen dry ans moisture.  2.Slip resistant: it can ensure you have a safe activity and non-skid backing keeps the rug in place and protects the floor.  3.Durable and stylish, sturdy edge stitching keep the rug mat in original good condition after multiple machine wash and longtime use. Fashion pattern design upgrade home and kitchen decor.  4.Soft mats suitable for indoor/outdoor door mats, kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, living room, dining room, office, porch, stairs, balcony, kid's room etc.  our rug machine wash and machine spin dry.  Yes, you can directly throw our rug into the washing machine and let it air dry after you settle it flat.What’s more, the rug’s color will not fade with continual uses.  Note:  1. Please kindly allow 1-2cm discrepancy.  2. To be convenient for transporting the slip are folded,which means, crease may exist when you received. The crease will disappear if you place it for 3-5 hours.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713WRqr8PpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANKINE","source_asin":"B08BPJKNRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BPJKNRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BPJKNRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":178436,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Automatic Can/Tin Opener, Touch and Go Professional Can Opener, Chef’s Best Choice (Red) M-1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dxudefYQL._AC_SL1170_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 15) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dxudefYQL._AC_SL1170_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALYWOOD","source_asin":"B08LTZZFFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LTZZFFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LTZZFFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
