window.products.push({"id":178495,"name":"Simple&Opulence 100% Pure Linen Duvet Cover with Embroidered,Twin Size(68\"x 86\"),2 Pieces Soft Flax Comforter Set with Button Closure,1 Duvet Cover an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0GPINvhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Twin Size&2 Pieces Bedding Set】Simple &Opulence bring you a luxurious linen bedding:1 duvet cover (68\" x 86\"),1 standard pillowcase(20\"x 26\"). Note: Duvet insert and pillows are not included.▲TIP:Each set has two spare buttons, don’t worry about losing the button. ▲ 【Material Advantages】Made of 100% European Flax Fabric with Stone Washed,160 g/m2.Linen is great for human health, has nice temperature moderation and breath-ability to help you fall asleep faster and sleep sounder,It’s light more breathable than cotton in Summer, but can keep cozy and warm in Winter.The natural characteristics after washing can still be preserved, not easy to fade and will more skin-friendly. An \"investment piece\" for your bedroom.OEKO-TEX Standard 100 Certified. 【Use Instruction】Linen is a slender fiber, please do not wash at high frequency. Regular washing will make linen softer and have a natural wrinkled appearance, which is one of the characteristics of linen fabric. Machine washable under 60℃; Do not use detergent that contains bleach or whitener. ✔TIPS✔Wash inside out, Natural dry is better！ 【Design&Gift】The linen product with solid color design, has exquisite embroidery on the duvet cover and pillowcase, great for farmhouse look.It will work fabulously with any interior decor,suitable for any room theme,making your room looks classy and clean. It is a good choice for your friends and family. (Birthday/Mother’s Day/Christmas/Wedding gift/Housewarming gift ...)Matching Euro Sham Cover : If You Need Extra Euro Sham Covers, Pls Search:B087FBK224. 【Corner Ties & Button Closure】Linen duvet cover has 4 interior corner ties inside, secure your comforter or duvet in right place to ensure tight sleep. The closure type is button, it has a fold cover that helps protect the buttons from being kicked loose.the see-through hidden button closure makes the quilt look more holistic. Find suitable Pillowcases, Comforter or Bedspread for hot sleeper, please search the Pillowcases ASIN B09KXR5YNC / B09D3GDB59 Comforter ASIN B08SR3NX5J / B0BDLNT824 and the Bedspread ASIN B097SRHYJM.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0GPINvhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple&Opulence","source_asin":"B08P4LFRX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4LFRX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4LFRX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
