window.products.push({"id":178681,"name":"Deals Dispatch Tea Infuser Set of Three (3) - Food Grade Silicone, Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-EesDJ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is nothing like coming home from a long day at work, putting on your comfy pants, stuffing some tea leaves in, and climbing into your own big bathtub. The hot steam will open your rubber pores, the warmth will help you relax. Just throw your arms over the edge and smile! If only you were as lucky as Mister Tea, this would be your relaxation ritual. But the rest of us live in the real world, with real humans and it's the little things that make your day. Little things like a tea infuser shaped like a little man with pants you can stuff with tea leaves! The Deals Dispatch Mr. Tea Infuser is the perfect tea-time companion. Just throw some tea in his trousers, perch him in your cup, relax for a minute as he does the work, and savor your perfect cup of tea. Molded from food-safe, tasteless, soft silicone rubber","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-EesDJ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deals Dispatch","source_asin":"B00MU156GA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MU156GA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MU156GA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
