window.products.push({"id":178688,"name":"Stackable Cookware Set Nonstick 100% PFOA Free Induction Pots and Pans Set Space Saving with Cooking Utensils 13 Piece – Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":214.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lHAhqsyqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥘 “SMART STORAGE - NEVER HIDE YOUR COOKWARE AGAIN”: tiny living, fast dining, storage and access, save space & space adaptation, extra functionalities during cooking 🥘 NON-STICK COATING: Interior & exterior is coated by high performance non-stick coating makes the pans and pots easy to cook and clean. Cooking with little oil for healthy diet. Safe temperature up to 260℃. 🥘 DETACHABLE HANDLE: Can be attached on any of the pan & pot. Heat resistant Bakelite body, it is super convenient to remove and install the handles. No need to drill or screw. Do not put this handle directly on the fire or do not heat it for a long time. 🥘 ERGONOMIC BAKELITE KNOB: COOKLOVER's stackable cookware sets builds with heat resistant soft touch silicone Bakelite knob and handle with beautiful wood grain design (NOT REAL WOOD). 🥘 UNIQUE TEMPERED SILICONE GLASS LID: with steam vent makes viewing food easily, heat-resistant and anti-slip Ergonomic knob is nice to grip, easy to maneuver, safe and anti-scald. One lid adapts to wok & casserole. 🥘 STURDY REINFORCED DIE-CAST ALUMINUM BODY: ensures fast, even heat distribution,4mm-4.5mm thicken bottom provides a stable heat distribution during cooking, rapidly heating up, saves time and energy, 2mm thickens aluminum body appropriate weight and heat conductive can ensure uniform heat dissipation and prevent hot spots. 🥘 COMPATIBLE INDUCTION BOTTOM: Conducts heat quickly and evenly, retain heat longer, saves energy and time which allows it to be placed evenly over heat source. Suitable for use on: Induction, gas, ceramic, electric, halogen & solid fuel cookers. (NOT OVEN SAFE) 🥘 THE WHOLE SET IN COMPACT AND EASY TO STACK FOR STORING PURPOSES: the lids seal from both sides, allowing the system to close. stackable system for enhancing storage in the kitchen. it can be placed on plain sight as an intriguing piece of furniture in the kitchen that sparks compliments, improves access & saves space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lHAhqsyqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOKLOVER","source_asin":"B08VDKJ9NH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDKJ9NH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDKJ9NH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
