window.products.push({"id":178734,"name":"Mini Portable Handheld fan, Small Desk Fan Foldable Hand Fan Hanging Neck Fan with lanyard, 3 Speed USB Fan with Phone Stand Power Bank, Hands Free Pe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K-zkstOGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【5 In 1 Multifunction Fan】One fan, five functions. Could be used as a neck fan, handheld fan, mini desk fan, phone stand and a power bank when in emergency. 5 in 1 design brings convenience for girls, boys, sporters, teenagers, office workers. 【Portable Mini Fan】This portable small personal fan is foldable design, Folding size only 3.35*3.15 inch, You can put it in your pocket or bag, also can wear this fan on a lanyard around your neck. The fan only 5.3 oz (150g) ! especially suitable for summer travel or outdoor sports, just take it wherever you want. 【Strong wind and Low noise】This mini USB handed fan built in 3000mAh large capacity rechargeable battery, which can last 6-12Hrs (depend on different speeds). It can adjust 3 wind speeds at will to meet any needs of you, just press the power button to change the wind speed setting. Long battery life, lasting cool, ULTRA-QUIET . You won’t worry about being disturbed when working or traveling. 【Phone Holder and Power Bank Function】The mini fan has a USB power output port, can charge phones at critical moments. The hidden mobile phone holder function is very practical. You can enjoy the coolness while doing your own things when you are at work, meetings, or watching dramas at home.When you exercise at home or follow the online tutorial to learn and exercise, You can watch the video while exercising without the need for an additional mobile phone holder 【Hand Free Design】This neck fan with removable and adjustable lanyard. When you prepare meals in the kitchen, go shopping with a shopping bag in your hand or play on the beach, hang it around your neck, free your hands, and can rotate 270° to adjust the wind direction at will from face to neck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K-zkstOGL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EYdoter","source_asin":"B09WD9HD8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WD9HD8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WD9HD8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
