window.products.push({"id":178854,"name":"Uttermara Wearable Blanket Sweatshirt for Women & Men, Sherpa Hoodie Blanket with Deep Front Pocket, Super Warm and Cozy Wearable Hoodie Blanket, Over","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712tYCCm6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient Wearable Blanket: Uttermara Sherpa hoodie blanket is comfortable and warm as ordinary blankets, convenient as a wearable blanket. It can keep you warm and comfortable in the cold days and nights, great companion for lounging at home, working at home, reading, napping, camping or outdoor activities. A must-have for leisure time Warm & Comfortable Companionship: This hoodie blanket offers upgraded comfort and softness - 200 GSM flannel on the front touches smooth, while the 220 GSM Sherpa inside feels soft, skin-friendly, and fluffy warm. All that will keep you warm and cozy all day long. Made of 100% high quality fabric, no shedding, no fading, easy to maintain, more durable Intimate Design: The blanket is large enough to keep every inch of your body warm. The huge kangaroo pocket can holds mobile phone, remote control, and snacks easily as well as warm your icy hands. Ribbed cuffs on the sleeves is elastic, fits wrists better, and allows you to push it up when you need to do some work or other activities. The oversized hood cradles your head warm and comfort One Size Fits All: The oversized hoodie blankets are available in adult and child sizes, fits for most people. Adult size fits most men and women, children size is for kids aged from 7 to 13. Gift this soft and comfortable oversized hoodie blanket to your friends and beloved ones, share the warmth and joy with them Machine Washable Hoodie Blanket: Uttermara Wearable Hoodie Blanket is easy to care. Machine washable in cold water and then tumble dry on low heat, it will comes out like new, saving you time and effort. Please kindly note that this hoodie cannot be dry cleaned, bleached, or ironed. We are all in for excellent user experience and provide worry-free warranty. Please contact us in case of product issues","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712tYCCm6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uttermara","source_asin":"B09MQFZMN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQFZMN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQFZMN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":178855,"name":"Urbanic 070s Electric Coffee Grinder (110~220v) / flat stainless steel burr 60mm / 20 steps can be set (Black)(Made in Korea)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":203.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J7epi33xL._AC_.jpg","description":"1. Easy Disassembly and cleaning. ✔ Can be disassembled and cleaned by hand without a screwdriver  ✔ The hopper and body can be easily separated. 2. Uniform and stable grinding. ✔ 20 levels of uniform and detailed ultra-fine grinding (any type of coffee can be expressed) ✔ Use of 60mm commercial stainless steel burr to maintain the original taste of the beans 3. Sophisticated design ✔ Sophisticated design with neat beige colors and manual finishing  ✔ Front push switch maximizes work efficiency 4. Overload Switch Mounted to Prevent Overheating of Motor 5. Anti-static extractors prevent powder from flying and clumping 6. Specification ✔ Model / Urbanic 070s Grinder ✔ Size / 200 * 130 * 360 (mm) ✔ Weight / 3.5kg ✔ Burr 60mm Flat ✔ Hopper / 250g ✔ Voltage / 110v & 220v/50-60Hz ✔ Power / 250w ✔ Manufacturer / Made in korea *Tip : The component of the product is a stainless head bottle that can receive 100g of beans. *Tip: If you adjust the grinding degree to 20>1, the dial may be stiff if there is beans between burr and burr. Turning the dial with force may change the zero point. In that case, turn the dial while operating the machine. * Caution: Please note if it stops working.1.Grinding with a thickness thinner than espresso may block the exit port and stop the operation.2.In this case, after disassembling the lock screw, clean the inside with a brush made of toothbrush and remove the beans attached to the blade.3.After that, press the red reset button located on the bottom(safe mode) of the machine and use it after 1 minute.4.This is not a product defect because the motor is a temporary phenomenon for self-defense.* We will respond strictly to those who abuse refunds due to a simple change of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J7epi33xL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urbanic","source_asin":"B0942VCBC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0942VCBC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0942VCBC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
