window.products.push({"id":178865,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking,Food Grade Olive Oil Spray Bottle BPA Free, 210ml Oil Spray Bottle, Cooking Oil Sprayer for Cooking Air Fryer Grilling BBQ Roa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p9q0eTKVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Oil Sprayer for cookingOur sprayer can spray cooking oil, vinegar, soy sauce, lemon juice, lime juice, cooking wine, sherry, water. It is exceptional suitable for spraying when you outdoor grilling, frying steak, baking, frying, making salads, picnics, and parties.It's also a great choice for watering flowers!--Healthy life by controlling oil intake. If you need a kitchen tool to help you control the oil intake, try our oil sprayer. Efficient use, no waste. Improve taste, be healthier.【🤷🏼How Get the Oil Sprayer Bottle Open】Please hold the fixed bottom with your right hand, turn it counterclockwise with your left hand to unscrew it. The left hand must be pressed down a little bit while twisting, so that it is easier to open.Please try the OPEN/CLOSE operation before adding the liquid,with a few more attempts, you can easily master the right way to use it.Specifications:Material: Food grade PET materialSize (Approx) : 8.27*2.36inchCapacity: 210 ml/7.0 ouncesPackage includes: 1 x Oil Sprayer(White) & 1 x Oil Brush(Red) & 1x Clean BrushPrecautions for use:1.We do not recommend using these sprayers to spray high-density olive oil. It may clog the nozzle.2.We suggest you clean the oil sprayer before filling, but the water temperature cannot be higher than 122 °F / 50°C.3.Oil or liquids may remain on the nozzle after using, please prepare tissue or cleaning cloth to wipe.4.Please don't put the bottle into the disinfection cabinet,microware oven and other appliances for high temperature disinfection.5.Loading liquid operation method：Please just hold the two parts of the bottle tightly and give a twist to close/open until you hear/feel the \"\"CLICK\"\"💖We are committed to customer satisfaction.If you have any problems with the oil sprayer bottle, please feel free to contact us and we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p9q0eTKVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeepAAA","source_asin":"B08VNKB2SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VNKB2SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VNKB2SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":178866,"name":"LUCKUP 100% Blackout Waterproof Fabric Window Roller Shades Blind, Thermal Insulated,UV Protection,for Bedrooms,Living Room,Bathroom,The Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VosPIHljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Excellent Material ] 100% Polyester +Reinforce Thermal Insulated Coating. 100% blackout. 100% UV ray block.Excellent for cool, windproof, rainproof. Suitable for use in bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, etc. Blackout roller shades protect the privacy of you and your family and protects you and your family from UV rays. [ Safety Design ] Special protection for children. Roller window shades are equipped with a chain connector. When your child or pet is entangled in the chain, it will be disconnected by a certain pulling force to prevent the child from being injured. You can adjust the length of the entire window shades by the chain. [ Inside Mounting ] Measure the height, width and depth of the window.The depth is at least 2.5 inch. For inside mount,blind width need to be at least 1/4 inch less than window width. There will be a tiny gap on each side,so the fabric width will be at least 1.5 inch smaller total. That is, fabric width is 40.5 inch. [ Outside Mounting ] Lower requirements than inside mount. Roller blinds width need to be 3-6 inch wider than window width,to avoid gaps. And the roller shades length need to be at least 6 inch longer than window length, to make sure to cover the entire window. [ Product dimension] 42\" W x 79\"L; The fabric width is 40.5 inch.Color: Grey.Our products are produced under strict requirements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VosPIHljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKUP","source_asin":"B09P568SKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P568SKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P568SKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
