window.products.push({"id":178931,"name":"Silicone Chocolate Cookie Candy Molds [Gingerbread House, 2-PC] - Non Stick, BPA Free, Reusable 100% Silicon & Dishwasher Safe Silicon - Kitchen Rubbe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GzSB+YMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Building a home for the holidays with a festive gingerbread house is so much easier with the right tools like the Freshware CB-700RD Silicone Gingerbread and Chocolate House Mold. Just simply push the dough into the mold’s cavities, bake, assemble the sides and roof together with colored icing and decorate with your favorite sweets like chocolate, candies, or gummy bears. This 2-piece mold creates roofs, windows, log walls, a door, a Christmas tree, and a lovely couple. Finished house measures about 6-inch wide x 5.5-inch long x 7-inch high. This mold would make a wonderful additional to any family gathering especially during the Christmas Holidays. This mold is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the baked goods to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Mold Size: 14 x 9.8 x 0.5 inch. 2 Pieces. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GzSB+YMcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B088ZSVR24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ZSVR24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ZSVR24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
