window.products.push({"id":178977,"name":"Chesapeake Bay Candle Reed Diffuser, Blood Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQhtxdQ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chesapeake Bay Candle heritage collection diffuser set embraces the natural, rustic charm of the Chesapeake Bay. The blood orange fragrance is an energizing, citrus scent with natural elements of mandarin and blood orange, reminiscent of a sunny afternoon by the Bay. A vibrant blend of passion flower, melon, and mango provide refreshing middle notes - followed by a touch of earthy cedar wood, sultry Honey, and a hint of intriguing pepper. The blood orange fragrance includes Essential oils of grapefruit and orange. To use the diffuser, carefully unpack all of the components. Set aside Dark colored diffuser reeds and ceramic shell. Remove plastic cap and seal from oil bottle and place oil bottle in diffuser shell. Replace ceramic lid and insert Dark colored reeds. Drawing upon inspiration from Maryland's idyllic shoreline, the diffuser set is available in 10 fragrances (other fragrances sold separately). this line contains fragrances inspired by local botanicals and fruits including sea grass, Magnolia, bergamot, rosemary, sage, and more. The fragrances provide Peace and serenity emanating from the open shoreline of the Chesapeake Bay - a calmness at the sight of open water, and a peaceful tranquility that brings perspective and relaxation to your home. Discover the finely-fragranced heritage collection, embracing the natural, rustic charm of the Chesapeake Bay and providing an array of soothing, energizing, and refreshing scents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQhtxdQ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B01BGRG2OI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-178977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BGRG2OI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BGRG2OI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
